<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <p class="sec-eye">Before you book</p>
  <h2>Questions about<br>group trips</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq6">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq6">Is Tulum safe and welcoming for queer and trans people?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. Tulum is an inclusive town where queer and trans people can just exist, not just visit. For the full, honest breakdown, read <a href="/blog/is-tulum-queer-trans-friendly">Is Tulum LGBTQ+ Friendly?</a></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq3">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq3">How is this different from other queer and sapphic trips?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">These trips are hosted by Santi Solis, founder of Queerness Experiences and a bicultural, bilingual, queer and trans biologist trained at UCLA, who created Camp Queerness and has been running tours for queer and trans travelers in Tulum for years. That means insight into Mexico you can only get from a local.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-min">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-min">How many people do I need for a private trip?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">From 3 to 13 people. If you have a group of three or more friends, we can arrange a camp for you. For one or two people, take a look at the <a href="/tours">tours</a>.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-price">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-price">How much does a camp cost?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Camps start at $4,000 USD per person for 4 days and 5 nights, flights not included. That covers your private villa with a private pool, most meals, airport pickup and drop-off, local transport, and your activities. Everything is flexible: we can add or remove nights, and the final price depends on your dates, your group size, and the activities you pick. Group rates are available. Tell us about your group and we'll send you a quote.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-incl">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-incl">What's included?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Most meals (some from a private chef, others at local restaurants and small businesses run by friends of ours), airport pickup and drop-off, your place to stay (a private villa with a private pool, picked for your group size), local transport, and all activities. Every activity is optional, and we personalize the trip to your group. Not included: flights and travel insurance. Tell us about dietary restrictions and allergies and we'll plan around them.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-diet">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-diet">Do you adjust for dietary restrictions?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. Tell us about any dietary restrictions, like gluten-free, when you book, and we'll adjust.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq1">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq1">Who can join Camp Queerness?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Camp Queerness is specifically for queer, sapphic, and trans travelers.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-reserve">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-reserve">How do I reserve my spot?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">I like to talk with everyone before they book, so we'll hop on a quick chat first (you can ask me anything then). From there, I'll send you the deposit info to lock in your spot. We highly recommend travel insurance.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="policy-link"><a href="/policies">Policies and disclaimers, including the liability release →</a></p>
</section>

